# Security policy

## Scope

This repository defines how the platform is built, released and deployed: the
CI image, the production image, the lock file and the deploy procedure. A flaw
here can reach every app and every environment.

## Reporting a vulnerability

Don't open a public issue. Report it privately through GitHub's private
vulnerability reporting:
[Report a vulnerability](https://github.com/@@OWNER@@/@@REPO_NAME@@/security/advisories/new).

You get an acknowledgement within 5 working days.

## Supported versions

Only the latest platform release and `main` receive fixes.
